WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Step 1: In Cal.com open Settings, then Developer, then API keys, and click New.

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 2: Keep API key selected and name it, for example RevOps agent.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Step 3: Turn on Never expires, so bookings keep flowing after the workshop.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Step 4: Click Create.

5
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 5: Copy the key with the clipboard icon. Cal.com shows it once.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Step 6: In your centre, paste it into Cal.com API key.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Step 7: Click Connect Cal.com. The agent checks the key by reading your profile.
